{"schema":1,"formId":"agency-41310-162546","title":"사실상 혼인관계 당사자의 보조생식술 동의서","lawTitle":"","sourceKind":"agency","source":{"path":"/forms/files/agency-41310-162546-7a63c610abd3.hwp","bytes":49152,"sha256":"7a63c610abd3263a652d872f692c4a67b89bb798d1c0b63f21e604c0e8861173","format":"hwp"},"asset":{"path":"/forms/writing/v1/converted/agency-41310-162546-7a63c610abd3-2b8f35a823ce.hwpx","bytes":42113,"sha256":"2b8f35a823ce6a47a2589b57a682f666421b450ebdff7ea3e7bf662c7ac0f59f"},"pageCount":1,"checkedAt":"2026-10-22","sourceTextSha256":"2f977e93074dd334e3764467ef44a3102816fc374e92c0c7ae3ed5c7883d748f","sections":[{"name":"Contents/section0.xml","tableCount":1,"paragraphCount":29}],"preview":{"textEntry":"Preview/PrvText.txt","exact":false,"limit":null,"dropEntries":["Preview/PrvImage.png"]},"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":null,"row":0,"col":0,"p":0},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"■ 난임부부 시술비 지원사업 [서식 제10호]"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":null,"row":0,"col":0,"p":3},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"사실상 혼인관계 당사자의 보조생식술 동의서"}]},{"kind":"table","index":0,"colCount":1,"rows":[[{"row":0,"col":0,"rowSpan":1,"colSpan":1,"role":"entry","nodes":[{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":0},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"  "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":1},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"두 당사자는 다음 각 사항을 안내받았으며 이견이 없음에 동의합니다."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":2},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":3},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":" 1. 두 당사자는 법률적 혼인관계가 아니지만, 1년 이상 혼인 의사가 존재하여 신청일 현재 동거 등 상호 합의 하에 실질적인 혼인관계를 유지하고 있습니다."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":4},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":5},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":" 2. 두 당사자가 만약 사실상 혼인관계가 아님에도 보조생식술 (인공수정 및 체외수정)의 건강보험 적용 및 정부지원 보조를 받기 위해 허위로 사실상 혼인관계를 주장한 경우, 관련비용의 환수는 물론 형법 등 관계법에 따라 처벌 등 법적 책임을 지는 것에 동의합니다."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":6},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":7},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":" 3. ‘난임부부 시술비 지원사업’을 신청하여 결정통지된 ‘사실상 혼인관계’는 보조생식술(인공수정 및 체외수정)의 건강보험 적용 및 정부지원 여부를 확인하기 위한 것이며, 그 외에 다른 법적 효력을 없음을 인지하였습니다."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":8},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":9},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"20   .    .    ."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":10},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":11},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":12},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   당사자1 :"},{"kind":"slot","id":"0/0/0/0/12#i9"},{"kind":"text","text":"(인)         연락처 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":13},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   생년월일 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":14},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   주소 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":15},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":16},"segments":[]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":17},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"  "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":18},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   당사자2 :"},{"kind":"slot","id":"0/0/0/0/18#i9"},{"kind":"text","text":"(인)         연락처 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":19},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   생년월일 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section":0,"table":0,"row":0,"col":0,"p":20},"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"   주소 : "}]},{"kind":"paragraph","at":{"section"